# examples/modular/mission.kaze — v0.5: one root, one library, one .kazebc.
#
#   kaze run examples/modular/mission.kaze --cap drone --cap sensor --cap log \
#     --ticks 2 --tick-ms 100 --sim temperature=35 --plain
#
# `use` is resolved relative to this file. The library's needs and items are
# inlined before this file's own, and the compiled artifact has no imports.

use "lib/sensors.kaze"

needs: drone, log

action main():
    log "mission starting"
    arm drone
    takeoff to 10 meters
